; Clink's own installer texts, included by Clink.iss. One block per language, in the order of [Languages]; english is the fallback.
; Rules: keep %1/%2 placeholders; never translate Clink, .NET, Windows or the code 1618; no %n (line breaks are added in [Code]).
; Saved as UTF-8 with BOM (kept for safety; ISCC 6.3+ also reads BOM-less UTF-8). tools\tests\installer-script.tests.ps1 checks that every language
; defines every key with the same placeholders.

[CustomMessages]

; ---- English ----
english.ClinkRuntimeTask=Install the Microsoft .NET %1 Desktop Runtime (required to run Clink)
english.ClinkRuntimeTaskGroup=Required component:
english.ClinkRuntimeOpenPagePrompt=Clink will not start until the .NET 10 Desktop Runtime (x64) is installed. Open the official download page now?
english.ClinkDownloadPageTitle=Downloading the .NET Desktop Runtime
english.ClinkDownloadPageDescription=Setup is downloading the Microsoft .NET Desktop Runtime and checking it.
english.ClinkDownloadFailed=The .NET Desktop Runtime could not be downloaded or did not pass its integrity check:
english.ClinkRetryYes=Yes: try again.
english.ClinkRetryNo=No: continue without it (you can install it later).
english.ClinkRuntimeNotRun=The downloaded .NET Desktop Runtime installer is missing or failed its integrity check, so it was not run.
english.ClinkRuntimeCouldNotStart=The .NET Desktop Runtime installer could not be started: %1 (code %2).
english.ClinkRuntimeNotDetected=The .NET Desktop Runtime installer finished but the runtime was not detected.
english.ClinkRuntimeCancelled=The .NET Desktop Runtime installation was cancelled.
english.ClinkRuntimeBusySilent=Another installation is in progress (code 1618), so the .NET Desktop Runtime was not installed.
english.ClinkRuntimeBusyPrompt1=Another installation is already in progress (code 1618), so the .NET Desktop Runtime could not be installed.
english.ClinkRuntimeBusyPrompt2=Finish or close the other installation, then choose Yes to try again, or No to continue without it.
english.ClinkRuntimeBusyNotInstalled=The .NET Desktop Runtime was not installed because another installation was in progress.
english.ClinkRuntimeFailedCode=The .NET Desktop Runtime installer failed with code %1.
english.ClinkRuntimeNotDownloaded=The .NET Desktop Runtime was not downloaded, so it was not installed.
english.ClinkReadyWarning1=Warning: the .NET 10 Desktop Runtime (x64) was not found and Setup will not install it.
english.ClinkReadyWarning2=Clink will not start until it is installed from %1

; ---- Spanish ----
spanish.ClinkRuntimeTask=Instalar Microsoft .NET %1 Desktop Runtime (necesario para ejecutar Clink)
spanish.ClinkRuntimeTaskGroup=Componente necesario:
spanish.ClinkRuntimeOpenPagePrompt=Clink no se iniciará hasta que se instale .NET 10 Desktop Runtime (x64). ¿Desea abrir ahora la página de descarga oficial?
spanish.ClinkDownloadPageTitle=Descargando .NET Desktop Runtime
spanish.ClinkDownloadPageDescription=El programa de instalación está descargando y comprobando Microsoft .NET Desktop Runtime.
spanish.ClinkDownloadFailed=No se pudo descargar .NET Desktop Runtime o no superó la comprobación de integridad:
spanish.ClinkRetryYes=Sí: volver a intentarlo.
spanish.ClinkRetryNo=No: continuar sin él (puede instalarlo más tarde).
spanish.ClinkRuntimeNotRun=Falta el instalador descargado de .NET Desktop Runtime o no superó la comprobación de integridad, por lo que no se ejecutó.
spanish.ClinkRuntimeCouldNotStart=No se pudo iniciar el instalador de .NET Desktop Runtime: %1 (código %2).
spanish.ClinkRuntimeNotDetected=El instalador de .NET Desktop Runtime finalizó, pero no se detectó el entorno de ejecución.
spanish.ClinkRuntimeCancelled=Se canceló la instalación de .NET Desktop Runtime.
spanish.ClinkRuntimeBusySilent=Hay otra instalación en curso (código 1618), por lo que no se instaló .NET Desktop Runtime.
spanish.ClinkRuntimeBusyPrompt1=Ya hay otra instalación en curso (código 1618), por lo que no se pudo instalar .NET Desktop Runtime.
spanish.ClinkRuntimeBusyPrompt2=Termine o cierre la otra instalación y elija Sí para volver a intentarlo, o No para continuar sin él.
spanish.ClinkRuntimeBusyNotInstalled=No se instaló .NET Desktop Runtime porque había otra instalación en curso.
spanish.ClinkRuntimeFailedCode=El instalador de .NET Desktop Runtime falló con el código %1.
spanish.ClinkRuntimeNotDownloaded=No se descargó .NET Desktop Runtime, por lo que no se instaló.
spanish.ClinkReadyWarning1=Advertencia: no se encontró .NET 10 Desktop Runtime (x64) y el programa de instalación no lo instalará.
spanish.ClinkReadyWarning2=Clink no se iniciará hasta que instale el entorno de ejecución desde %1

; ---- French ----
french.ClinkRuntimeTask=Installer Microsoft .NET %1 Desktop Runtime (nécessaire pour exécuter Clink)
french.ClinkRuntimeTaskGroup=Composant requis :
french.ClinkRuntimeOpenPagePrompt=Clink ne démarrera pas tant que .NET 10 Desktop Runtime (x64) n'est pas installé. Ouvrir la page de téléchargement officielle maintenant ?
french.ClinkDownloadPageTitle=Téléchargement de .NET Desktop Runtime
french.ClinkDownloadPageDescription=Le programme d'installation télécharge Microsoft .NET Desktop Runtime et le vérifie.
french.ClinkDownloadFailed=Impossible de télécharger .NET Desktop Runtime, ou le contrôle d'intégrité a échoué :
french.ClinkRetryYes=Oui : réessayer.
french.ClinkRetryNo=Non : continuer sans l'installer (vous pourrez l'installer plus tard).
french.ClinkRuntimeNotRun=Le programme d'installation téléchargé de .NET Desktop Runtime est introuvable ou a échoué au contrôle d'intégrité ; il n'a donc pas été exécuté.
french.ClinkRuntimeCouldNotStart=Impossible de démarrer le programme d'installation de .NET Desktop Runtime : %1 (code %2).
french.ClinkRuntimeNotDetected=Le programme d'installation de .NET Desktop Runtime s'est terminé, mais l'environnement d'exécution n'a pas été détecté.
french.ClinkRuntimeCancelled=L'installation de .NET Desktop Runtime a été annulée.
french.ClinkRuntimeBusySilent=Une autre installation est en cours (code 1618) ; .NET Desktop Runtime n'a donc pas été installé.
french.ClinkRuntimeBusyPrompt1=Une autre installation est déjà en cours (code 1618) ; .NET Desktop Runtime n'a donc pas pu être installé.
french.ClinkRuntimeBusyPrompt2=Terminez ou fermez l'autre installation, puis choisissez Oui pour réessayer, ou Non pour continuer sans l'installer.
french.ClinkRuntimeBusyNotInstalled=.NET Desktop Runtime n'a pas été installé car une autre installation était en cours.
french.ClinkRuntimeFailedCode=Le programme d'installation de .NET Desktop Runtime a échoué avec le code %1.
french.ClinkRuntimeNotDownloaded=.NET Desktop Runtime n'a pas été téléchargé ; il n'a donc pas été installé.
french.ClinkReadyWarning1=Attention : .NET 10 Desktop Runtime (x64) est introuvable et le programme d'installation ne l'installera pas.
french.ClinkReadyWarning2=Clink ne démarrera pas tant que le runtime n'aura pas été installé depuis %1

; ---- German ----
german.ClinkRuntimeTask=Microsoft .NET %1 Desktop Runtime installieren (erforderlich, um Clink auszuführen)
german.ClinkRuntimeTaskGroup=Erforderliche Komponente:
german.ClinkRuntimeOpenPagePrompt=Clink startet erst, wenn die .NET 10 Desktop Runtime (x64) installiert ist. Jetzt die offizielle Download-Seite öffnen?
german.ClinkDownloadPageTitle=.NET Desktop Runtime wird heruntergeladen
german.ClinkDownloadPageDescription=Das Setup lädt die Microsoft .NET Desktop Runtime herunter und überprüft sie.
german.ClinkDownloadFailed=Die .NET Desktop Runtime konnte nicht heruntergeladen werden oder hat die Integritätsprüfung nicht bestanden:
german.ClinkRetryYes=Ja: erneut versuchen.
german.ClinkRetryNo=Nein: ohne sie fortfahren (Sie können sie später installieren).
german.ClinkRuntimeNotRun=Das heruntergeladene Installationsprogramm der .NET Desktop Runtime fehlt oder hat die Integritätsprüfung nicht bestanden und wurde deshalb nicht ausgeführt.
german.ClinkRuntimeCouldNotStart=Das Installationsprogramm der .NET Desktop Runtime konnte nicht gestartet werden: %1 (Code %2).
german.ClinkRuntimeNotDetected=Das Installationsprogramm der .NET Desktop Runtime wurde beendet, die Runtime wurde jedoch nicht erkannt.
german.ClinkRuntimeCancelled=Die Installation der .NET Desktop Runtime wurde abgebrochen.
german.ClinkRuntimeBusySilent=Eine andere Installation läuft bereits (Code 1618); die .NET Desktop Runtime wurde deshalb nicht installiert.
german.ClinkRuntimeBusyPrompt1=Eine andere Installation läuft bereits (Code 1618); die .NET Desktop Runtime konnte deshalb nicht installiert werden.
german.ClinkRuntimeBusyPrompt2=Beenden oder schließen Sie die andere Installation und wählen Sie dann Ja, um es erneut zu versuchen, oder Nein, um ohne sie fortzufahren.
german.ClinkRuntimeBusyNotInstalled=Die .NET Desktop Runtime wurde nicht installiert, weil gerade eine andere Installation lief.
german.ClinkRuntimeFailedCode=Das Installationsprogramm der .NET Desktop Runtime ist mit Code %1 fehlgeschlagen.
german.ClinkRuntimeNotDownloaded=Die .NET Desktop Runtime wurde nicht heruntergeladen und deshalb nicht installiert.
german.ClinkReadyWarning1=Warnung: Die .NET 10 Desktop Runtime (x64) wurde nicht gefunden und wird vom Setup nicht installiert.
german.ClinkReadyWarning2=Clink startet erst, wenn sie von %1 installiert wurde

; ---- Brazilian Portuguese ----
brazilianportuguese.ClinkRuntimeTask=Instalar o Microsoft .NET %1 Desktop Runtime (necessário para executar o Clink)
brazilianportuguese.ClinkRuntimeTaskGroup=Componente necessário:
brazilianportuguese.ClinkRuntimeOpenPagePrompt=O Clink não será iniciado até que o .NET 10 Desktop Runtime (x64) seja instalado. Abrir a página de download oficial agora?
brazilianportuguese.ClinkDownloadPageTitle=Baixando o .NET Desktop Runtime
brazilianportuguese.ClinkDownloadPageDescription=O instalador está baixando e verificando o Microsoft .NET Desktop Runtime.
brazilianportuguese.ClinkDownloadFailed=Não foi possível baixar o .NET Desktop Runtime ou ele não passou na verificação de integridade:
brazilianportuguese.ClinkRetryYes=Sim: tentar novamente.
brazilianportuguese.ClinkRetryNo=Não: continuar sem ele (você pode instalá-lo depois).
brazilianportuguese.ClinkRuntimeNotRun=O instalador baixado do .NET Desktop Runtime está ausente ou não passou na verificação de integridade, por isso não foi executado.
brazilianportuguese.ClinkRuntimeCouldNotStart=Não foi possível iniciar o instalador do .NET Desktop Runtime: %1 (código %2).
brazilianportuguese.ClinkRuntimeNotDetected=O instalador do .NET Desktop Runtime foi concluído, mas o runtime não foi detectado.
brazilianportuguese.ClinkRuntimeCancelled=A instalação do .NET Desktop Runtime foi cancelada.
brazilianportuguese.ClinkRuntimeBusySilent=Outra instalação está em andamento (código 1618), por isso o .NET Desktop Runtime não foi instalado.
brazilianportuguese.ClinkRuntimeBusyPrompt1=Outra instalação já está em andamento (código 1618), por isso não foi possível instalar o .NET Desktop Runtime.
brazilianportuguese.ClinkRuntimeBusyPrompt2=Conclua ou feche a outra instalação e escolha Sim para tentar novamente ou Não para continuar sem ele.
brazilianportuguese.ClinkRuntimeBusyNotInstalled=O .NET Desktop Runtime não foi instalado porque outra instalação estava em andamento.
brazilianportuguese.ClinkRuntimeFailedCode=O instalador do .NET Desktop Runtime falhou com o código %1.
brazilianportuguese.ClinkRuntimeNotDownloaded=O .NET Desktop Runtime não foi baixado, por isso não foi instalado.
brazilianportuguese.ClinkReadyWarning1=Aviso: o .NET 10 Desktop Runtime (x64) não foi encontrado e o instalador não o instalará.
brazilianportuguese.ClinkReadyWarning2=O Clink não será iniciado até que o runtime seja instalado a partir de %1

